{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/ev1x23cnth443f5ox7av5e3a5rr50pg.mp3","text":"博士，我正在待机。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/bmva2o25my6v06w544efrub6qudsb2m.mp3","text":"这盾牌吗？其实这家伙所需的能量，有一部分是由俺亲自提供的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/6pnqk8xk2aj9gj40n785ltx597v6s71.mp3","text":"面具下面的样子吗......哈，还是暂时先保密吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/l09zoevc7nldvu1apn3xwkvuhsltnsx.mp3","text":"任务完成之后的休息时间是最棒的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_004.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:4/47/0fwxhxq1nyjvsvlydujwl65ngxmf0bg.mp3","text":"博士，俺觉得，如果能更多地了解你，说不定这面盾牌也会变得更坚固。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/13/2njc02dsmb5tbmqqg2qc1wuyze2bz4c.mp3","text":"其实俺知道自己的极限在什么地方。但是，俺不想让夜刀对俺放心不下，这很重要。其他的，以后再说吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/68/avxcjuhc6o4j4bducgqkhmf42ttmo9r.mp3","text":"无论什么地方，都需要俺这样的人对吧？不，俺可没有得意忘形。俺要说的是，大人物遭遇危险的时候，总得有挺身保护他们的那种人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/a2gf0833nsyp3cegs4zk6kksaed7v9u.mp3","text":"偶尔也得摘下面具，放松放松啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/37qpnybm6l2bjpagoowawxyxq3ybaxp.mp3","text":"重装干员黑角，要员保护的活儿就交给俺吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/af/7r7vcv9ejnjjo2a94vyhw584m67xmwu.mp3","text":"原来如此，巡林者老爷子提过的战术就是这个啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_012.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/hanx2j04rwjde3odqu82axkaqhsxso1.mp3","text":"同行又增加了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/trnujmbsa95agfyaw7gnbls1ppvd7w8.mp3","text":"今后俺会变得更加强悍！","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/gwty5piczj5cer2hbfqvjb7fgigg3km.mp3","text":"坚守最前线，是俺们重装干员最重要的任务。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/grm6zyoezxgovndtbk18jeqp3pz5f6s.mp3","text":"开始战斗吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/t8pow2i2p0fqblge6hg2s8zfl66zm4j.mp3","text":"您说说看？","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/77/mzr90prjvm4x6cpjk0avmg2tl8nqcyi.mp3","text":"怎么了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/75bzn2xxdxogwby8s9eq9wzw8e1sq38.mp3","text":"交给俺吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/4mbb42zykesr8npcfw34z355w3sbpes.mp3","text":"俺，来了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/h9rp31ql5htia8awcv6nqshs69r9eea.mp3","text":"小心！","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/93/nzu2xtdylpx22nc09bxw6tky5bdeesb.mp3","text":"加强防御!","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_026.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/54/ox4vldmmostvew0lkx99g8dyeyynyf8.mp3","text":"就算是俺这样的人，能参与这样激烈的战斗也会很高兴的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/1m5r1fqu2fslktth5sbo3pvganpy35f.mp3","text":"这点小事，不算什么。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/f32ajcocceld7y3102ic3wjamprzqt1.mp3","text":"哎，马马虎虎吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:4/46/1h4vgqxuvsuynjgfdsvplc8tw9yw2xt.mp3","text":"就是因为没有戴上最好的面具，才会变成这样的！可恶啊啊啊啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/13sxjjpcekkb5zajrdvhuvo8flq53z2.mp3","text":"嗯，好好休息吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/q2woopu0xfvo4xf1lk1us1i3j1x9drv.mp3","text":"唔？","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/hr0wr3o2jltly6itp2i9fpgvjok2mt9.mp3","text":"下班后去好好喝一顿吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/kjdata1napqm2jih0nc41ax66vmpn1r.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/336531b016zmmaebf7vz8fvjaopgnba.mp3","text":"俺可最喜欢这种日子了，大家都高高兴兴聚在一块，也不用干什么活。来，博士，快尝尝，刚出锅的烧炸驮兽肠！哎哎，凯尔希医生应该不让您喝这么多酒的吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/gueg27g89hsmnfyur7vp051ncdy55xg.mp3","text":"博士，没有异常。","alt":"voice_cn/char_500_noirc/cn_0